Firmware: Arm Mali CSF GPU firmware (mali_csffw.bin) from linux-firmware
          20260410, the program of the GPU's Command Stream Frontend
          microcontroller
Hardware: Arm Mali-G310 (Valhall, arch 10) of the Amlogic S905X5M
          (ODROID-C5), used by the mali driver (CONFIG_DRIVER_MALI_GPU)
Files:    /lib/firmware/arm/mali/arch10.8/mali_csffw.bin
          /lib/firmware/arm/mali/arch10.10/mali_csffw.bin
          /lib/firmware/arm/mali/arch10.12/mali_csffw.bin
          (one program; linux-firmware ships the same bytes under the three
          names)
Source:   linux-firmware tag 20260410 (commit dc85ccedc9c973682fbcf4d628ca61174bcc3120)

